      "info": {
        "contact": {
          "url": "https://agify.io/"
        },
        "description": "Estimate age from names. Integrate age inference directly into workflows and perform efficient inference on big datasets with simple APIs. Enrich data with demographic insights.",
        "servers": [
          {
            "description": "Production server",
            "url": "https://api.agify.io"
          }
        ],
        "termsOfService": "https://agify.io/",
        "title": "Agify.io",
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "tagline": "Estimate a person's age from their first name using a dataset of around 1 billion names",
        "homepage": "https://agify.io/",
        "docs_url": "https://agify.io/documentation",
        "license_short": "Commercial service operated by Demografix ApS; free tier available, paid plans for higher volume.",
        "license_md": "- Operated by Demografix ApS (Roskilde, Denmark).\n- Free tier: 2,500 names/month, no credit card required.\n- Paid plans start at $20/month for higher volume.\n- See agify.io for Terms of Service, Privacy Policy and GDPR / Data Processing Agreement.",
        "about_md": "Agify is a name-to-age inference API operated by [Demografix ApS](https://agify.io/) in Roskilde, Denmark. It predicts a likely age for a given first name by correlating name popularity cycles with birth years across a dataset of roughly a billion people. Agify is one of a family of three sister APIs alongside [Genderize.io](https://genderize.io/) (gender from names) and [Nationalize.io](https://nationalize.io/) (nationality from names).\n\n**What you get from the API:**\n\n- `name` — the submitted name, echoed back\n- `age` — the predicted age\n- `count` — the number of records the prediction was based on\n\nThe service supports full name parsing, diacritics and non-Latin alphabets, and optional geographic scoping to a specific country for improved accuracy.\n\nRequests go to `https://api.agify.io` over HTTPS as a simple `GET` with a `name` query parameter; CORS is enabled. An `apikey` query parameter is required — sign in at agify.io to obtain one. The free tier allows 2,500 names per month.",
        "entity_desc": {
          "get_age": "A single name-lookup resource that returns an estimated age, exposed at `/?name=...` on `https://api.agify.io`."
        },
